: "", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}, "460112": {"id": 460112, "motion_name": "motions/login.mtn", "touch_area": "0", "probability": 1.0, "voice": "GUN|AKAlfa_0|HELLO", "delay": 0, "is_hurt": 0}}, "voiceData": {"460101": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "460102": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "460103": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "460104": {"char_code": "AKAlfa_0", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE3", "caption": "I wear my gas mask when I head out... The air is really bad outside, right? If my circuits get contaminated, I won't grow any taller."}, "460105": {"char_code": "AKAlfa_0", "voice_key": "DIALOGUE1", "caption": "The sun, the moon, the stars, and tin foil... They're all shiny, and so are the Commander's buttons. Um, may I take a closer look at your buttons?"}, "460106": {"char_code": "AKAlfa_0", "voice_key": "WIN", "caption": "You're so cool, Commander. Will I ever grow to be this cool?"}, "460107": {"char_code": "AKAlfa_0", "voice_key": "BUILDOVER", "caption": "Um, would you like some sour plum drink?"}, "460108": {"char_code": "AKAlfa_0", "voice_key": "OPERATIONBEGIN", "caption": "I hope I'll find a piece of meteorite on this trip."}, "460109": {"char_code": "AKAlfa_0", "voice_key": "DIALOGUEWEDDING", "caption": "I want to be of more help to you, so I've been reading more books lately. But sci-fi is so much more exciting than non-fiction. Do you like sci-fi, Commander?"}, "460110": {"char_code": "AKAlfa_0", "voice_key": "SOULCONTRACT", "caption": "You and me, Commander? Hmm... <>I hear this is a very solemn oath. I'm not sure if I'm good enough for this. <>But I'll do my best, because you're the stars to me!"}, "460111": {"char_code": "", "voice_key": "", "caption": ""}, "460112": {"char_code": "AKAlfa_0", "voice_key": "HELLO", "caption": "Huh, here already? Crap, my thermos is still open."}}}